{"id":"vod_zy360_67783","vodId":"67783","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"精灵使的剑舞","name_cn":"精灵使的剑舞","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241107-1/482bbb5777e8334c4a91dca74c0d0b86.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在艾雷西亚精灵学院之中，在这里学习深造的都是出身名门的千金大小姐们，她们要学会如何成为一名合格的精灵使。风早神人（古川慎配音）是一名平凡的十六岁少年，一次意外之中，他撞见了少女克雷尔（木户衣吹配音）出浴时的模样，又在误打误撞之中和她签订了契约，就这样，风早神人成为了学院之中唯一的男性精灵使。成熟可靠温文尔雅的琳丝蕾特（优木加奈配音），一本正经循规蹈矩的艾莉丝（石上静香配音），表面看来大大咧咧但内心却十分娇羞的菲雅娜（大西沙织配音），在这些可爱女孩子们的围绕下，神人会有着怎样趣味横生的校园生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-07 16:52:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/9TeToYM5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/uSU1xpZg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/Vmw01zgl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/sAEUybpM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/ycf7DQql/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/QpRCBjZE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/tcsto3kw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/U1bdWele/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/KPA2sHaI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/RgZ8eZbF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/OM9IxfhC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/u0hThAcD/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:10.440Z"}